{"id":16521,"author":"BmB","body":"Look i don't want to sound aggressive in my appeal but this is the second time, i even put on the post where i said i was Gimpus that it had already been sorted with SR staff yet i am banned again today. I don't \u0026nbsp;blame the staff member as i guess he couldn't know but could i please be unbanned?","body_tagged":"Look i don't want to sound aggressive in my appeal but this is the second time, i even put on the post where i said i was Gimpus that it had already been sorted with SR staff yet i am banned again today. I don't \u0026nbsp;blame the staff member as i guess he couldn't know but could i please be unbanned?","created_at":1441916230,"title":"Appeal : \"Ban evading Gimpus\" again..","replies":[{"id":228689,"author":"Pelpelajax","body":"What's the story?","body_tagged":"What's the story?","created_at":1441950718},{"id":228773,"author":"BmB","body":"so I had both my accounts BmB and Gimpus banned at one point. The staff knew i was Gimpus so when I made my original appeal I also mentioned that it was an appeal for Gimpus, they said that's fine and that they could still only urban 1 account, I \u0026nbsp;already have been banned for ban evading Gimpus, 'Ban evasion radiqal' (name change) so I don't really understand why I have been banned again.","body_tagged":"so I had both my accounts BmB and Gimpus banned at one point. The staff knew i was Gimpus so when I made my original appeal I also mentioned that it was an appeal for Gimpus, they said that's fine and that they could still only urban 1 account, I \u0026nbsp;already have been banned for ban evading Gimpus, 'Ban evasion radiqal' (name change) so I don't really understand why I have been banned again.","created_at":1441981256,"reply_to":228689},{"id":228782,"author":"Pelpelajax","body":"Where's the old appeal?","body_tagged":"Where's the old appeal?","created_at":1441987065,"reply_to":228773},{"id":228783,"author":"BmB","body":"\u003cdiv class=\"row-fluid\" style=\"width